// codegen: a code generator written in Cone. It compiles its lower form (ir.cone) to machine code for x64 (ARM64
// later) and loads it into executable memory. It knows nothing of ConeScript: conescript\src\native.cone lifts verified
// ConeScript code into this form. Design: MyDrive\Incubator\3D Web\WI\native-backend-design-2026-11-28.md.
//
// The files of src:
//   ir.cone          the lower form: ops, Func, FuncBuilder, the context layout (the interface)
//   regalloc.cone    liveness, intervals and linear scan over the register files it is given
//   x64enc.cone      the x64 encoder: REX, ModRM, SIB, labels and rel32 fix-ups (checked against LLVM in tests\)
//   x64.cone         the x64 emitter and the entry stub: compileX64
//   machinecode.cone MachineCode, and its stored form (encode, decode)
//   execmem.cone     executable memory: load, LoadedCode.call and free

mod codegen;

import collections use *;
